  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>X</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;are unit vectors in the directions of sides&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mover><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;respectively,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0015_90152f453ce0.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>X</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>Z</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></mfrac><mtext>&#8201;</mtext></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>